SUMMARY:Seeking Women for Leadership Roles
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nLancaster Freethought Society i
 s growing\, and **we want more women involved in shaping where the group g
 oes next.**\nWe are particularly interested in women who might consider be
 coming **co-equal organizers on the Leadership Team**\, but you don’t ne
 ed to be ready to make that commitment to join us.\nOver lunch\, we’ll t
 alk about:\n\n* What women value about LFS\n* What could make the group mo
 re welcoming and useful to women\n* What kinds of events and community we 
 want\n* What shared\, egalitarian leadership could look like\n* Whether yo
 u might want to take a leadership role\n\nCome meet other women in LFS\, e
 at\, talk\, and help imagine what this group could become.\n**September 26
  — 551 West\, Lancaster**
