SUMMARY:LFS @PA Renaissance Faire 🏰👸🍻
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\n🎶"I-i-i went to the Renaissa
 nce Faire one day..."🎶\nBe among the Brave\, Beautiful\, and admittedly
  Bawdy this September 27th!⚔️👑😻 The past comes to meet you in a 
 day full of Minstrels\, Jesters\, Swooning Lovers\, and the occasional Ine
 briated Duel.🍖🥙🍺 The Faire this year is under new ownership by a 
 company that operates three others\, and features all-new actors and an en
 tirely-redone\, royal assortment of comfort foods.\n\nYou will be able to 
 find us in line at 10:30AM\, and then just inside the gates after 11AM. Ju
 st look for Hazel\, our ever well-behaved and friendly Akita.🐕\nA day o
 f Food and Frivolity awaits!🏰\n\n****this event is IN ADDITION TO the "
 Yuletide @the Shire" event LFS is doing on November 29th****\n\nEach atten
 dee is responsible for purchasing their own ticket(s)\, available on the P
 aRenFaire website:\nhttps://www.parenfaire.com/\n\n(tickets sell out surpr
 isingly fast 🎟️)\n\nSept 27th -Gates open 11AM.\nEvent is Reign or Sh
 ine👸🌤️\n\nPA Renaissance Faire (on the grounds of Mt Hope Estate/W
 inery)\n2775 Lebanon Rd\, Manheim\, PA 17545\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/TtAZ
 MLgNpfMrxtSh9?g_st=ic
