SUMMARY:"September" Movie Night!  (Oct 10 lol)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\n"September's" movie night will 
 be mid October\, to fit into venue availability! This month\, we will be s
 howing from the following films:\n\nA Scanner Darkly\n-Trailer- https://ww
 w.youtube.com/watch?v=VUB4s-bHHoQ\n\nAltered States\n-Trailer- https://www
 .youtube.com/watch?v=0XNVQ4ILPBA\n\nBattleship Potemkin\n-Trailer- https:/
 /www.youtube.com/watch?v=2j5PzBitIGI\n\nMarjoe\n-Trailer- https://www.yout
 ube.com/watch?v=Ui7Pz4blum0&t=161s\n\nAnd many\, many more! Bring your own
  film selections and we may decide to show them!\n\nAdmission is Free! Bri
 ng as many family members and friends as you would like! Please RSVP! Disc
 ussion after the movie(s)\, hang out and share your thoughts!\n\nSome drin
 ks and snacks will be provided\, please do bring more to share!\nPizza wil
 l be ordered\, please do chip in if you partake in delivered food!\n\nSatu
 rday\, October 10th\, 6:00pm - 10:00pm\nOther Room Theater\n715 N. Pine St
 .\nLancaster PA 17603\n\nWe can delay starting the movie to give people ti
 me to arrive\, but no later than 6:30pm\, please try to arrive before then
  if you do not want to miss any of the movie.\n\nPICTURED below is the mai
 n entrance\, the event space is right up the stairs. On street parking sho
 uld be available\, several public parking lots such as behind CVS are with
 in a 2 blocks walk along Harrisburg Pike.
