DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nOur first event will be held on
  Tuesday\, October 13\, 2026 from 1 pm to 3 pm. You are welcome to come fo
 r community\, a simple craft or bring your own project and bring your own 
 food and beverage\, if you want. In Lancaster\, but RSVP for address. Oh\,
  and bring a friend!
